- The gunshot holds no fear.

335
00:36:14,774 --> 00:36:17,208
The gunshot holds no fear! Say it.

336
00:36:17,310 --> 00:36:19,278
- The gunshot holds no fear.
- Louder!

337
00:36:19,379 --> 00:36:21,347
- The gunshot holds no fear!
- Louder!

338
00:36:21,447 --> 00:36:23,671
