459
00:46:04,196 --> 00:46:06,164
you're gonna play the piano.

460
00:46:06,265 --> 00:46:08,199
Whatever.

461
00:46:08,300 --> 00:46:10,768
Baby.

462
00:46:10,870 --> 00:46:13,430
