but I could still swim.

467
00:46:35,227 --> 00:46:37,559
Sam, get back.

468
00:46:37,663 --> 00:46:40,530
Don't be a crybaby.
You're tougher than that.

469
00:46:40,633 --> 00:46:43,101
<i>Sit, sit, sit, sit, sit, sit.</i>

470
00:46:45,404 --> 00:46:49,170
